            "review_title": "Review at Bun Cha Bun Nem Ha Noi",
            "review_text": "Daisuke\nTokyo, Japan13 contributions\n0\nEat like Obama and Bourdain!\nJul 2017 • Couples\nBun Cha Hanoi! The dish made famous by Obama and Bourdain during their visit to Vietnam in 2016. A very simple dish from Hanoi, vermicelli noodles with different grilled meat in a light fish sauce served with different herbs. Order a side of Nem Ran (egg rolls) for a full bowl of goodness. Very reasonably priced (30-40k dong, $2, for the Bun Cha Hanoi and another 30-40 for some Nem Ran). A must tried Vietnamese food experience. Highly recommended.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 6, 2017",
